From 4e1482c44958c423619aa8fbb334e7463ace1a06 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.local>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 20:10:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/11] Phase 8: tap-to-play video player dialog, wired to
 DownloadAdapter/DownloadQueueSheet

- Add VideoPlayerDialogFragment: full-screen DialogFragment owning one
  ExoPlayer for one local file, reusing the Media3 stack ShortsFragment
  (Phase 2) already depends on instead of a second video library.
- Add dialog_video_player.xml (PlayerView with controller + close button)
  and Theme.Cobalt.FullScreenDialog.
- DownloadAdapter: completed rows with mimeType video/* now route
  btnOpen to the in-app player instead of always ACTION_VIEW; non-video
  completed downloads keep the pre-existing system hand-off.
- DownloadQueueSheet: supplies the onPlay callback and shows the dialog
  via parentFragmentManager.
- Lifecycle: pause() on onPause, release() on onDestroyView, matching
  ShortsFragment's discipline (full hardening pass is Phase 18).
